#. そんなの証拠にならないよ！
#. 写真はねつ造に決まってるもん！
msgctxt "0001 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "You can't prove that! Those photos are all fakes!"
msgstr ""

#. だって、モノクマに渡されたものなんだよ！？
#. そんなのひとつで、記憶失ったなんて言えないよ！
msgctxt "0002 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"You're really gonna say we all got amnesia cuz of\n"
"something MONOKUMA gave us!?"
msgstr ""

#. 苗木の言ってる事はおかしいよ！
msgctxt "0003 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Don't make me laugh!"
msgstr ""

#. だって、私は学園に来る
#. 前の日の事だって覚えてるもん！
msgctxt "0004 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"I remember everything that happened before I got to\n"
"this school!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>もう一度、よく考えてみるんだ。
#. どこかにこの議論の矛盾が隠されているはず…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I need to think about it one more time. There must be\n"
"a contradiction in there somewhere...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Mình cần phải suy nghĩ lại một lần nữa. Chắc chắn phải có\n"
"điểm mâu thuẫn nào đó trong này...\n"
"<CLT>"

#. <CLT 4>信じたくなくても、
#. それが事実なら認めなくちゃいけない…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Even if we don't want to believe it, if it's the\n"
"truth, we don't have a choice...!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>でなきゃ、ボクらは終わってしまう…！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Otherwise, we'll all die in here!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ボク達全員が記憶喪失と考えられる根拠は、
#. あの<CLT><CLT 3>集合写真以外<CLT><CLT 4>にあったはずだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There must be more evidence than <CLT><CLT 3>those pictures<CLT><CLT 4> that\n"
"we all lost our memories...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
